<style type="text/css">
/* Images always fill the preview's width, regardless of their natural
   size or any width/height attributes on the <img> tag itself. Kept here
   (applied globally) rather than per-image in the Markdown source, so
   dropped/typed images can use plain ![]() syntax. */
img { width: 100% !important; }
</style>

